{"title":"Career roadmap · Web Designer","role":"Web Designer","summary":"A Web Designer creates the visual, interactive and user-experience layer of websites and digital products.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Web Designer creates the visual, interactive and user-experience layer of websites and digital products."},{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA graduate specialising in Multimedia & Animation / UI-UX, the strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UI/UX design"},{"text":"Visual design"},{"text":"HTML/CSS"},{"text":"JavaScript fundamentals"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"Animation/motion"},{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Web performance"},{"text":"Basic front-end development"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The modern Web Designer is increasingly expected to understand both design and implementation."},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","UI/UX","Figma","HTML/CSS","JavaScript","Responsive Design","Accessibility","Design Systems","Basic Front-End Development"],"sep":"+","label":"Best-fit combination"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"UG Year 1"},{"text":"Design fundamentals + HTML/CSS"}],[{"text":"UG Year 2"},{"text":"UI/UX + JavaScript + prototyping"}],[{"text":"UG Year 3"},{"text":"Design systems + accessibility + real projects"}],[{"text":"Final year"},{"text":"Portfolio + internship + live project"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Web Designer / UI Designer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Web Designer / UI/UX Designer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior UI/UX Designer / Product Designer"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Design Lead / UX Lead"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Design Director / Head of Design"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the BCA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design + web fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with the fundamentals rather than immediately copying website designs."},{"type":"h","text":"Visual design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Layout"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Alignment"},{"text":"Hierarchy"},{"text":"Contrast"},{"text":"Balance"},{"text":"Spacing"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Grid systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typography"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Font families"},{"text":"Font weights"},{"text":"Line height"},{"text":"Letter spacing"},{"text":"Text hierarchy"},{"text":"Readability"},{"text":"Responsive typography"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Colour"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Primary/secondary colours"},{"text":"Contrast"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Semantic colours"},{"text":"Brand palettes"},{"text":"Dark/light themes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — HTML and CSS"},{"type":"p","text":"A Web Designer should understand how their designs translate into actual web pages."},{"type":"h","text":"HTML"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Semantic HTML"},{"text":"Headings"},{"text":"Forms"},{"text":"Links"},{"text":"Images"},{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Sections"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Accessibility attributes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CSS"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Box model"},{"text":"Flexbox"},{"text":"Grid"},{"text":"Positioning"},{"text":"Responsive layouts"},{"text":"Media queries"},{"text":"Transitions"},{"text":"Animations"},{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Pseudo-elements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Responsive design"},{"type":"p","text":"Design for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mobile"},{"text":"Tablet"},{"text":"Desktop"},{"text":"Large screens"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Think:"},{"type":"h","text":"One design system → multiple screen sizes"}]},{"heading":"UI/UX fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"UX"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User research"},{"text":"User personas"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"User flows"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Wireframing"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"Accessibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical UX workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Research","User insights","Information architecture","Wireframes","Prototype","Usability testing","UI design","Development","Iteration"]}]},{"heading":"Figma","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become highly comfortable with Figma."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Frames"},{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Auto Layout"},{"text":"Variants"},{"text":"Constraints"},{"text":"Styles"},{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Design libraries"},{"text":"Developer handoff"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Build a reusable component library"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Buttons"},{"text":"Inputs"},{"text":"Dropdowns"},{"text":"Cards"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Modals"},{"text":"Tabs"},{"text":"Alerts"},{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Forms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This introduces the student to design systems, which are highly valuable professionally."}]},{"heading":"User research","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A good Web Designer should understand why a design works, not only whether it looks attractive."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"User journey mapping"},{"text":"Pain-point identification"},{"text":"Basic analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"If users abandon a registration form:"},{"type":"p","text":"Don't immediately redesign the colours."},{"type":"p","text":"Investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Number of fields"},{"text":"Form complexity"},{"text":"Error messages"},{"text":"Mobile usability"},{"text":"Trust"},{"text":"Loading speed"},{"text":"User intent"}]}]},{"heading":"Interaction design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Buttons"},{"text":"Hover states"},{"text":"Focus states"},{"text":"Form validation"},{"text":"Loading states"},{"text":"Empty states"},{"text":"Error states"},{"text":"Success states"},{"text":"Micro-interactions"},{"text":"Navigation patterns"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Every important UI element should have appropriate states."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Button"},{"type":"flow","items":["Default","Hover","Focus","Active","Disabled","Loading","Success"]}]},{"heading":"Responsive web design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build designs using a mobile-first mindset."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Breakpoints"},{"text":"Fluid layouts"},{"text":"Flexible typography"},{"text":"Responsive images"},{"text":"Touch targets"},{"text":"Mobile navigation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Test designs at:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"320–375px"},{"text":"768px"},{"text":"1024px"},{"text":"1440px+"},{"text":"Large displays"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact breakpoint values should follow the design/system requirements rather than being treated as universal rules."}]},{"heading":"JavaScript fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Web Designer doesn't necessarily need full-stack JavaScript expertise."},{"type":"p","text":"But understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Arrays"},{"text":"Objects"},{"text":"Events"},{"text":"DOM"},{"text":"Forms"},{"text":"API calls"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Basic asynchronous programming"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This allows you to create realistic interactions instead of static mockups."}]},{"heading":"Modern front-end","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn one modern front-end framework at a basic-to-intermediate level."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended"},{"type":"h","text":"React"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Props"},{"text":"State"},{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Conditional rendering"},{"text":"Lists"},{"text":"Forms"},{"text":"Basic routing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective isn't to become a full-stack developer."},{"type":"p","text":"It's to bridge:"},{"type":"h","text":"Design → Working Interface"}]},{"heading":"Accessibility","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Accessibility should be part of the design process from the beginning."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Semantic HTML"},{"text":"Keyboard navigation"},{"text":"Focus states"},{"text":"Colour contrast"},{"text":"Alt text"},{"text":"Form labels"},{"text":"Accessible error messages"},{"text":"Screen-reader basics"},{"text":"Responsive text"},{"text":"Reduced-motion preferences"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Think about:"},{"type":"p","text":"Can someone with different visual, motor or cognitive needs use this interface?"}]},{"heading":"Web performance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Design decisions affect performance."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Image optimisation"},{"text":"Image formats"},{"text":"Lazy loading"},{"text":"Font loading"},{"text":"Animation performance"},{"text":"JavaScript overhead"},{"text":"Layout shifts"},{"text":"Page speed"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basics of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LCP"},{"text":"INP"},{"text":"CLS"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A visually beautiful website that loads slowly can still be a poor user experience."}]},{"heading":"Multimedia and animation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because the degree includes Multimedia & Animation, use that background as a differentiator."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Motion design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Micro-interactions"},{"text":"Page transitions"},{"text":"Scroll animations"},{"text":"Loading animations"},{"text":"Motion hierarchy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on interests:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"After Effects"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Blender"},{"text":"Premiere Pro"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Don't make every element animated."},{"type":"p","text":"Use motion to communicate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"State"},{"text":"Hierarchy"},{"text":"Feedback"},{"text":"Continuity"}]}]},{"heading":"Design systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This becomes important as projects become larger."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design tokens"},{"text":"Typography scales"},{"text":"Spacing systems"},{"text":"Colour tokens"},{"text":"Component libraries"},{"text":"Naming conventions"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Versioning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of individually defining:"},{"type":"p","text":"17px here, 19px there, 23px somewhere else"},{"type":"p","text":"use a consistent:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Spacing","Typography","Colour","Component system"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This makes designs easier to maintain."}]},{"heading":"Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build 5–6 strong portfolio projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Responsive business website"},{"type":"p","text":"Design and build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Home"},{"text":"About"},{"text":"Services"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Contact"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Grid"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"HTML/CSS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — E-commerce website"},{"type":"p","text":"Design:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product listing"},{"text":"Product details"},{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Cart"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Order confirmation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrates:"},{"type":"flow","items":["UX","conversion-oriented design","responsive UI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — SaaS dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dashboard"},{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Settings"},{"text":"Notifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates professional product UI skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Mobile-first application"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a complete mobile experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Onboarding"},{"text":"Login"},{"text":"Home"},{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Profile"},{"text":"Settings"},{"text":"Notifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User flow"},{"text":"Wireframes"},{"text":"Prototype"},{"text":"Usability testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Design system"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete design system containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Colours"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Buttons"},{"text":"Forms"},{"text":"Cards"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Modals"},{"text":"Alerts"},{"text":"Documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can strongly differentiate the portfolio from simple landing-page designs."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Redesign case study"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose an existing product and redesign a problematic user flow."},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Existing experience","Research","Problems","Hypothesis","Wireframes","Final UI","Prototype","Testing","Improvements"]},{"type":"p","text":"The case study process is often more valuable than simply showing screenshots."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year capstone"},{"type":"h","text":"End-to-End Digital Product Design & Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete product:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User Research","User Journey","Information Architecture","Wireframes","UI Design","Design System","Prototype","HTML/CSS/React","Testing","Deployment"]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Performance optimisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates that the student can work across the complete product lifecycle."}]},{"heading":"Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For Web Design, the portfolio is arguably the most important career asset."},{"type":"h","text":"Each case study should show:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem"},{"text":"Target users"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"User flow"},{"text":"Wireframes"},{"text":"Design decisions"},{"text":"Prototype"},{"text":"Final UI"},{"text":"Responsive versions"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"Final outcome"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Don't simply display:"},{"type":"p","text":"10 beautiful screenshots."},{"type":"p","text":"Show:"},{"type":"p","text":"How you think and solve design problems."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Target roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Web Design Intern"},{"text":"UI Design Intern"},{"text":"UX Design Intern"},{"text":"UI/UX Intern"},{"text":"Product Design Intern"},{"text":"Front-End Design Intern"},{"text":"Visual Design Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Good environments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product startups"},{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Digital agencies"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Consumer applications"},{"text":"Design studios"}]},{"type":"h","text":"High-value internship"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for roles where you participate in:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Design","Prototype","Development","Testing"]},{"type":"p","text":"rather than only:"},{"type":"p","text":"Create social media posters."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are secondary to portfolio quality."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"UX research"},{"text":"UI design"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"HTML/CSS"},{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"React"},{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"Web performance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Optional certifications can demonstrate structured learning, but they should not replace real projects."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Web Designer"},{"text":"Web Designer"},{"text":"UI Designer"},{"text":"Junior UI/UX Designer"},{"text":"UX Design Associate"},{"text":"Visual Designer"},{"text":"Digital Designer"},{"text":"Front-End Designer"},{"text":"Junior Product Designer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UI/UX Designer"},{"text":"Product Designer"},{"text":"UX Designer"},{"text":"Interaction Designer"},{"text":"Design Systems Designer"},{"text":"Senior Web Designer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Product Designer"},{"text":"UX Lead"},{"text":"Design Lead"},{"text":"Design Systems Lead"},{"text":"UX Manager"},{"text":"Design Director"}]}]},{"heading":"What recruiters may test","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Spacing"},{"text":"Grid"},{"text":"Hierarchy"},{"text":"Visual balance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"UX"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User flows"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Wireframes"},{"text":"Usability"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Accessibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Figma"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Auto Layout"},{"text":"Variants"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Design systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Web"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML"},{"text":"CSS"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"Browser behaviour"},{"text":"Basic JavaScript"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Design challenge"},{"type":"p","text":"You may receive:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Design a checkout page for a mobile e-commerce application.\""},{"type":"p","text":"A strong response should demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Understand user","identify requirements","define flow","wireframe","design","prototype","test","iterate"]}]},{"heading":"Scenario-based interviews","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Scenario 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Users aren't completing a registration form. What would you do?"},{"type":"p","text":"Investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Form length"},{"text":"Required fields"},{"text":"Error handling"},{"text":"Mobile usability"},{"text":"CTA clarity"},{"text":"Trust signals"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"User intent"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then test improvements."},{"type":"h","text":"Scenario 2"},{"type":"p","text":"The client wants 10 different colours on the website."},{"type":"p","text":"Don't simply reject it."},{"type":"p","text":"Establish:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brand requirements"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Semantic colour usage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then create a structured design system."},{"type":"h","text":"Scenario 3"},{"type":"p","text":"A developer says your design cannot be implemented."},{"type":"p","text":"A good designer should:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand the technical constraint"},{"text":"Discuss alternatives"},{"text":"Preserve the user goal"},{"text":"Adapt the design if necessary"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Strong designers collaborate with engineers rather than treating design and development as separate worlds."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's is not mandatory for Web Design."},{"type":"p","text":"Portfolio and professional experience generally matter heavily."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant options"},{"type":"h","text":"M.Des"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"Product design"},{"text":"Design research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MCA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical web development"},{"text":"Software engineering"},{"text":"Front-end development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Multimedia / Animation"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visual design"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Interactive media"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful later for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Design management"},{"text":"Business leadership"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For pure Web/UI/UX careers:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Strong portfolio","internship","practical experience"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"can be more valuable than immediately pursuing a master's."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's fields:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"UX Design"},{"text":"Product Design"},{"text":"Digital Media"},{"text":"Visual Communication"},{"text":"Information Experience Design"},{"text":"Creative Technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Singapore"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technically inclined BCA graduate, HCI/UX + computer science can provide a strong bridge between design and technology."}]},{"heading":"Career specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After 2–4 years, choose a direction."},{"type":"h","text":"UI Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visual systems"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Design systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"UX Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Usability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["UX","UI","business","technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Tokens"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Governance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"UX Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Design","HTML/CSS","JavaScript","React"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly suitable for a BCA graduate."},{"type":"h","text":"Motion/UI Animation"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["UI","motion","interaction","animation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"AI + Web Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is changing the design workflow rapidly."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wireframe generation"},{"text":"Design exploration"},{"text":"Content generation"},{"text":"Image generation"},{"text":"Prototype generation"},{"text":"Code generation"},{"text":"Usability analysis"},{"text":"Accessibility checks"},{"text":"Design variations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But don't become dependent on AI-generated designs."},{"type":"p","text":"The valuable skill remains:"},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding users and making defensible design decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"AI can generate ten layouts; the designer must determine which layout actually solves the user's problem."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 career evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Traditional:"},{"type":"h","text":"Web Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product/UI/UX Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Future:"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Designer / UX Engineer / Spatial & AI Interface Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Web experiences will increasingly include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI interfaces"},{"text":"Voice interaction"},{"text":"Multimodal interfaces"},{"text":"Generative UI"},{"text":"Personalised interfaces"},{"text":"Spatial interfaces"},{"text":"Conversational interfaces"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This means designers will increasingly need to understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Visual design","UX","technology","AI interaction."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 1 — Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UI design"},{"text":"UX"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Layout"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 2 — Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"After Effects"},{"text":"Blender basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 3 — Web"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML"},{"text":"CSS"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"JavaScript"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 4 — UX"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User research"},{"text":"User flows"},{"text":"Wireframes"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"Accessibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 5 — Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"React"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Browser DevTools"},{"text":"Web performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 6 — Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"UX engineering"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"AI-assisted design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal portfolio by graduation"},{"type":"table","header":["Project","Demonstrates"],"rows":[[{"text":"Responsive business website"},{"text":"Web design"}],[{"text":"E-commerce UX"},{"text":"Conversion + UX"}],[{"text":"SaaS dashboard"},{"text":"Product UI"}],[{"text":"Mobile application"},{"text":"Mobile UX"}],[{"text":"Design system"},{"text":"Scalable UI"}],[{"text":"Redesign case study"},{"text":"Problem solving"}],[{"text":"Working React implementation"},{"text":"Design + development"}]]}]},{"heading":"Target progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Visual Design + HTML/CSS"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"UI/UX + Figma + JavaScript"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Design Systems + Accessibility + React"}],[{"text":"Final year"},{"text":"Portfolio + Internship + Capstone"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Web/UI Designer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Web/UI/UX/Product Designer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Product Designer"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Design Lead"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Design Director / Head of Design"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For BCA – Multimedia & Animation / UI-UX → Web Designer, don't build a profile around only Figma screenshots or graphic-design certificates."},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","Visual Design Fundamentals","HTML + CSS","UI/UX + Figma","User Research + Prototyping","Responsive + Accessible Design","JavaScript + React","Design Systems + Web Performance","UX Engineering / Product Design"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is a designer who can understand users, create a high-quality design system, prototype the experience, and communicate effectively with developers—and ideally implement parts of the interface themselves."},{"type":"p","text":"That combination gives the graduate a progression from Web Designer → UI/UX Designer → Product Designer → Senior Designer → Design Lead, while also creating a strong alternative pathway into UX Engineering and front-end development."}]}]}